      "text": "Stored function: all business rules\nfirms + payments; no new tables\n\nLock firm IDs in ascending order\nCheck history after acquiring locks\nCheck gross outgoing funds\nInsert + balance deltas atomically\nCOMMIT or full ROLLBACK\n\nAuthoritative mode: ON / OFF",
