      "locked": false,
      "text": "Function-local database setting; default ON\nAPI callers cannot choose or override effective mode\nEach API exposes database-derived mode + instance identity\nRunner compares DB + all 3 APIs + Nginx with expected mode\nAbort tests on mismatch; run ON and OFF on fresh fixtures\nChange mode only with payment traffic stopped",
      "originalText": "Function-local database setting; default ON\nAPI callers cannot choose or override effective mode\nEach API exposes database-derived mode + instance identity\nRunner compares DB + all 3 APIs + Nginx with expected mode\nAbort tests on mismatch; run ON and OFF on fresh fixtures\nChange mode only with payment traffic stopped",
